title: Paradigm Ambient v5.0–5.3 complete, Maestro team collaboration spec finalized
summary: 'Shipped the full ambient coordination system across 8 commits (v5.1.0–v5.3.3): nomination engine, 7 MCP tools, data policy enforcement, Platform UI with SSE, Symphony relay, journal-to-notebook promotion, surfacing config, graduation candidates, PARA 601 university course. Field-tested in deus-backend — found and fixed 4 critical bugs (post-write hook JSON corruption, scoring always 1.0, nomination spam, hook events invisible to nominations). Pivoted the Conductor team collaboration spec from persistent headless agents (token-bleeding) to Maestro model (subagent spawns with learning, 30-40x cheaper). Spec covers 5 phases through Neverland validation.'
